1
00:00:07,240 --> 00:00:12,080
=Fatal Proximity to Him=

2
00:00:12,080 --> 00:00:14,120
=Episode 12=

3
00:00:39,240 --> 00:00:40,040
You're here.

4
00:00:46,640 --> 00:00:47,600
How's your hand?

5
00:00:48,320 --> 00:00:49,560
Nothing too serious.

6
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:53,440
After Wang Haotian got away that day,

7
00:00:54,640 --> 00:00:55,920
I didn't expect you to run into him.

8
00:00:56,680 --> 00:00:57,640
He had a knife.

9
00:00:59,520 --> 00:01:00,440
By the time I saw it,

10
00:01:01,920 --> 00:01:03,000
it was already too late.

11
00:01:05,080 --> 00:01:06,400
Did they catch Wang Haotian?

12
00:01:10,760 --> 00:01:12,400
Wang Haotian's lawyer claims

13
00:01:13,120 --> 00:01:14,320
you attacked him first,

14
00:01:14,680 --> 00:01:15,920
and that he just went too far
defending himself.

15
00:01:16,400 --> 00:01:17,600
At most, he'll have to pay damages.

16
00:01:18,120 --> 00:01:19,120
He's unlikely to go to prison.

17
00:01:22,600 --> 00:01:23,280
Don't move.

18
00:01:23,440 --> 00:01:24,720
Mind the IV in your hand.

19
00:01:27,760 --> 00:01:28,640
For now,

20
00:01:29,520 --> 00:01:31,240
please help take care of my mom.

21
00:01:32,760 --> 00:01:34,040
Don't tell her about any of this.

22
00:01:39,240 --> 00:01:39,960
Don't worry.

23
00:01:48,320 --> 00:01:49,040
Xiyu,

24
00:01:50,480 --> 00:01:51,520
I've got

25
00:01:51,760 --> 00:01:53,040
some things to handle at work.

26
00:01:53,640 --> 00:01:54,280
I'll leave you two to it.

27
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:04,400
Three tendons were severed.

28
00:02:06,200 --> 00:02:07,200
That must hurt.

29
00:02:08,400 --> 00:02:09,640
I'm on painkillers.

30
00:02:14,800 --> 00:02:15,720
So...

31
00:02:16,400 --> 00:02:17,720
what did the doctor say?

32
00:02:19,800 --> 00:02:21,280
The doctor said

33
00:02:22,200 --> 00:02:23,680
with proper rehab,

34
00:02:25,800 --> 00:02:26,680
everyday life

35
00:02:26,880 --> 00:02:27,800
shouldn't be a problem.

36
00:02:29,760 --> 00:02:30,240
Then...

37
00:02:31,280 --> 00:02:32,560
what about surgery?

38
00:02:38,520 --> 00:02:39,960
(I ruined this man's life.)

39
00:02:40,600 --> 00:02:41,800
(I can't love him,)

40
00:02:42,440 --> 00:02:44,600
(and now I've cost him
his chance to operate again.)

41
00:02:55,120 --> 00:02:56,400
You're with He Lan now?

42
00:03:15,440 --> 00:03:16,520
I still lost.

43
00:03:24,920 --> 00:03:25,760
I'm sorry.

44
00:03:25,760 --> 00:03:26,360
Xiyu,

45
00:03:27,760 --> 00:03:28,800
don't say that.

46
00:03:30,120 --> 00:03:31,600
♪Not every memory♪

47
00:03:31,600 --> 00:03:32,800
I don't want your pity.

48
00:03:32,800 --> 00:03:34,240
♪Should be etched in my heart♪

49
00:03:34,240 --> 00:03:35,480
♪Not every love♪

50
00:03:35,480 --> 00:03:36,600
I want you to be happy.

51
00:03:36,600 --> 00:03:37,960
♪Is meant to last♪

52
00:03:38,160 --> 00:03:39,960
♪You don't have to make this so hard♪

53
00:03:39,960 --> 00:03:42,480
♪I'll be the one to walk away♪

54
00:03:45,520 --> 00:03:47,440
♪Walking away♪

55
00:03:47,440 --> 00:03:49,640
♪Doesn't mean betraying true love♪

56
00:03:49,760 --> 00:03:51,640
♪Blame me for giving this my all♪

57
00:03:51,640 --> 00:03:53,120
♪I let love tie me down♪

58
00:03:53,440 --> 00:03:54,920
♪How do I let you go♪

59
00:03:55,360 --> 00:03:56,960
♪How do I erase you♪

60
00:03:57,560 --> 00:03:58,800
♪For good♪

61
00:04:16,720 --> 00:04:19,440
Could Wang Haotian be the one
I anger in every lifetime?

62
00:04:19,840 --> 00:04:21,440
Is he the one trying to kill me?

63
00:04:23,600 --> 00:04:26,000
This time, Zhang Jinghang
got dragged into it because of me too.

64
00:04:46,960 --> 00:04:48,080
(I can't tell you.)

65
00:04:49,280 --> 00:04:50,840
(But I really am sorry.)

66
00:04:56,920 --> 00:04:57,760
Song Shuqi.

67
00:05:01,400 --> 00:05:02,800
Do you know Zhang Jinghang's hand
is ruined?

68
00:05:04,960 --> 00:05:06,800
Who asked him to get involved?

69
00:05:07,360 --> 00:05:08,840
If he'd stayed out of it,
none of this would've happened.

70
00:05:10,280 --> 00:05:11,640
How can you say that?

71
00:05:13,400 --> 00:05:14,720
We're both women.

72
00:05:15,320 --> 00:05:17,200
You knew exactly what could happen to me

73
00:05:17,200 --> 00:05:18,280
when you tricked me
into Wang Haotian's car,

74
00:05:19,160 --> 00:05:20,760
and you still chose to do it.

75
00:05:21,720 --> 00:05:23,080
What else was I supposed to do?

76
00:05:23,400 --> 00:05:23,920
Huh?

77
00:05:24,400 --> 00:05:26,240
He had my video!

78
00:05:26,360 --> 00:05:27,920
If I didn't do what he said

79
00:05:28,040 --> 00:05:29,520
and he posted it online,

80
00:05:29,560 --> 00:05:30,600
my life would've been over!

81
00:05:30,760 --> 00:05:32,080
And what about my life?

82
00:05:32,800 --> 00:05:35,600
I only got mixed up with Wang Haotian
because I was trying to protect you.

83
00:05:35,640 --> 00:05:36,880
And because I was protecting you,

84
00:05:37,160 --> 00:05:39,600
Zhang Jinghang's future
has been destroyed too.

85
00:05:40,400 --> 00:05:41,680
I never asked you to protect me!

86
00:05:42,760 --> 00:05:44,400
If you hadn't gotten involved,

87
00:05:44,720 --> 00:05:46,520
things wouldn't have gone this far.

88
00:05:47,200 --> 00:05:47,640
Right.

89
00:05:48,760 --> 00:05:50,960
You get to do whatever you want,

90
00:05:51,160 --> 00:05:53,640
because there's always someone
behind you cleaning up your mess,

91
00:05:53,720 --> 00:05:54,520
like He Lan

92
00:05:54,680 --> 00:05:55,560
and Zhang Jinghang.

93
00:05:56,440 --> 00:05:57,240
I don't have that.

94
00:05:57,800 --> 00:05:59,360
I only have myself.

95
00:05:59,760 --> 00:06:01,200
Do you really think giving
in to Wang Haotian

96
00:06:01,200 --> 00:06:02,240
will make him leave you alone?

97
00:06:02,960 --> 00:06:03,880
It won't.

98
00:06:04,400 --> 00:06:05,640
Once he's had his fill of those videos,

99
00:06:05,640 --> 00:06:06,920
he'll sell them anyway.

100
00:06:08,040 --> 00:06:09,840
When Wang Haotian threatened you,

101
00:06:09,840 --> 00:06:11,120
you could've told me.

102
00:06:11,120 --> 00:06:13,400
And we could've worked together
to put him behind bars.

103
00:06:13,400 --> 00:06:15,080
Then you wouldn't have to live in fear.

104
00:06:16,200 --> 00:06:17,040
But you didn't.

105
00:06:18,200 --> 00:06:19,080
Song Shuqi,

106
00:06:20,160 --> 00:06:21,280
you chose to do this.

107
00:06:22,520 --> 00:06:24,560
Can you really say you didn't do it
from selfish motives?

108
00:06:31,280 --> 00:06:33,400
You've always been so lucky.

109
00:06:34,240 --> 00:06:35,000
Everything you want

110
00:06:35,000 --> 00:06:37,080
just seems to fall into your lap.

111
00:06:37,760 --> 00:06:38,840
But not for me.

112
00:06:39,720 --> 00:06:40,600
Do you know

113
00:06:41,080 --> 00:06:42,920
that whenever you're around,

114
00:06:43,160 --> 00:06:45,320
I'm always just the one
standing in your shadow?

115
00:06:46,680 --> 00:06:47,800
You're the White Swan,

116
00:06:47,800 --> 00:06:49,560
and I'm stuck being the Black Swan.

117
00:06:51,800 --> 00:06:53,240
No matter how hard I work,

118
00:06:53,560 --> 00:06:54,840
no matter how good I am,

119
00:06:55,960 --> 00:06:56,720
in the end,

120
00:06:57,160 --> 00:06:59,400
I only become the standard
people use to praise you.

121
00:07:01,480 --> 00:07:03,200
"Song Shuqi is really good."

122
00:07:04,000 --> 00:07:05,760
"But Luo Xiyu is even better."

123
00:07:07,840 --> 00:07:09,200
Do you know what that feels like?

124
00:07:10,680 --> 00:07:11,760
I'll never

125
00:07:12,280 --> 00:07:13,320
be better than you.

126
00:07:14,560 --> 00:07:16,120
How could I not hate you?

127
00:07:19,960 --> 00:07:21,920
The Black Swan isn't any easier
than the White Swan.

128
00:07:24,120 --> 00:07:27,120
You dance the Black Swan
not because you're less skilled than me.

129
00:07:28,680 --> 00:07:29,920
It's because your heart is black.

130
00:07:51,320 --> 00:07:53,200
Still blaming yourself
for what happened to Zhang Jinghang?

131
00:07:55,400 --> 00:07:57,400
He'll never be able
to hold a scalpel again.

132
00:07:59,240 --> 00:08:00,640
Ever since he was little,

133
00:08:00,960 --> 00:08:02,480
his mom was always sick.

134
00:08:03,640 --> 00:08:04,400
So,

135
00:08:04,920 --> 00:08:06,600
he always wanted to become a doctor.

136
00:08:07,840 --> 00:08:09,200
Just like I love dancing.

137
00:08:10,160 --> 00:08:11,000
His dream

138
00:08:11,240 --> 00:08:13,560
was to stand at an operating table
and save lives.

139
00:08:16,760 --> 00:08:18,400
Wang Haotian isn't going to stop here.

140
00:08:18,960 --> 00:08:19,920
You think so too?

141
00:08:24,040 --> 00:08:25,200
Do you believe in fate?

142
00:08:28,680 --> 00:08:30,000
I believe we make our own fate.

143
00:08:38,160 --> 00:08:38,760
Alright.

144
00:08:39,480 --> 00:08:40,440
I'll see you upstairs.

145
00:08:43,320 --> 00:08:44,720
My mom happens to be home today.

146
00:08:46,080 --> 00:08:47,640
I want to officially
introduce you to her.

147
00:08:56,040 --> 00:08:56,560
Mom.

148
00:08:57,000 --> 00:08:57,720
You're back.

149
00:08:58,040 --> 00:08:59,080
Wash your hands. Dinner's ready.

150
00:08:59,400 --> 00:09:02,400
I made chicken soup
with cordyceps flowers today.

151
00:09:05,200 --> 00:09:06,880
I invited He Lan over

152
00:09:07,120 --> 00:09:08,160
at the last minute.

153
00:09:08,800 --> 00:09:10,160
I didn't get a chance to tell you.

154
00:09:11,400 --> 00:09:12,120
Hello, ma'am.

155
00:09:13,920 --> 00:09:14,760
Well, you're already here.

156
00:09:15,560 --> 00:09:16,560
Take a seat and eat with us.

157
00:09:34,040 --> 00:09:34,640
Um...

158
00:09:34,800 --> 00:09:35,320
Mom,

159
00:09:36,400 --> 00:09:37,720
He Lan and I

160
00:09:38,280 --> 00:09:39,800
are officially together now.

161
00:09:40,400 --> 00:09:41,720
He's my boyfriend.

162
00:09:45,960 --> 00:09:46,640
Ma'am,

163
00:09:47,560 --> 00:09:49,160
I know you have concerns about me.

164
00:09:50,320 --> 00:09:51,040
I...

165
00:09:51,280 --> 00:09:52,080
went to prison before

166
00:09:52,120 --> 00:09:52,920
and have a criminal record.

167
00:09:53,520 --> 00:09:54,960
But I have a good job now,

168
00:09:54,960 --> 00:09:55,880
and I own a place.

169
00:09:56,280 --> 00:09:58,280
I won't let Xiyu struggle
if she's with me.

170
00:09:59,920 --> 00:10:00,520
He Lan,

171
00:10:01,040 --> 00:10:02,000
you must think

172
00:10:02,320 --> 00:10:04,280
I'm a very materialistic mother.

173
00:10:05,680 --> 00:10:06,600
It is me

174
00:10:07,400 --> 00:10:08,200
who sent the letters back.

175
00:10:08,680 --> 00:10:09,480
Letters?

176
00:10:11,840 --> 00:10:12,880
What letters?

177
00:10:14,480 --> 00:10:14,960
Oh,

178
00:10:15,240 --> 00:10:16,000
it was nothing.

179
00:10:17,120 --> 00:10:18,000
I just

180
00:10:18,400 --> 00:10:20,000
wanted to tell you I'd gotten out early.

181
00:10:22,480 --> 00:10:23,320
So you...

182
00:10:23,600 --> 00:10:24,200
He Lan,

183
00:10:24,720 --> 00:10:26,080
the reason I opposed you two

184
00:10:26,560 --> 00:10:27,760
wasn't just because

185
00:10:28,000 --> 00:10:28,760
you'd been to prison.

186
00:10:29,480 --> 00:10:30,400
It was because

187
00:10:32,040 --> 00:10:33,920
I knew how deeply Xiyu felt about you.

188
00:10:34,040 --> 00:10:35,120
She gave too much of herself.

189
00:10:35,560 --> 00:10:36,840
Love that intense

190
00:10:37,120 --> 00:10:38,160
can wear a person down.

191
00:10:39,760 --> 00:10:40,680
I wanted

192
00:10:40,840 --> 00:10:42,800
Xiyu to find someone
who loved her even more,

193
00:10:43,880 --> 00:10:45,120
and live a peaceful, steady life.

194
00:10:45,760 --> 00:10:46,400
That way,

195
00:10:46,880 --> 00:10:47,960
she'd be less likely to get hurt.

196
00:10:48,560 --> 00:10:49,160
Mom,

197
00:10:49,600 --> 00:10:51,080
that's not really living a steady life.

198
00:10:51,080 --> 00:10:52,680
That's basically being alive
with a dead soul.

199
00:10:53,080 --> 00:10:54,560
I didn't listen to you back then

200
00:10:54,600 --> 00:10:55,760
when you told me to go to top
universities and become a civil servant

201
00:10:55,760 --> 00:10:58,240
because I never wanted
that kind of life.

202
00:10:58,800 --> 00:10:59,440
Ma'am.

203
00:11:02,000 --> 00:11:02,920
Please trust me.

204
00:11:04,040 --> 00:11:05,680
I won't let Xiyu get hurt.

205
00:11:06,320 --> 00:11:08,440
We truly hope we can have your blessing.

206
00:11:17,320 --> 00:11:18,320
Try the chicken soup

207
00:11:18,680 --> 00:11:19,360
while it's hot.

208
00:11:34,240 --> 00:11:34,760
Mom.

209
00:11:44,000 --> 00:11:44,640
It's good.

210
00:11:45,520 --> 00:11:46,560
Tastes like home.

211
00:11:47,920 --> 00:11:48,680
If you like it,

212
00:11:49,560 --> 00:11:50,360
come over more often.

213
00:12:07,440 --> 00:12:08,480
I want to show you something.

214
00:12:20,200 --> 00:12:20,800
Look.

215
00:12:21,680 --> 00:12:22,520
They're still brand new.

216
00:12:23,960 --> 00:12:25,600
Whenever I missed you

217
00:12:26,200 --> 00:12:28,000
or hit a wall with my dancing,

218
00:12:29,120 --> 00:12:29,920
I'd look at them,

219
00:12:30,440 --> 00:12:32,000
and somehow I'd feel strong again.

220
00:12:33,720 --> 00:12:34,840
Why haven't you worn them?

221
00:12:35,440 --> 00:12:36,360
I couldn't bear to.

222
00:12:37,080 --> 00:12:38,960
Pointe shoes don't last very long.

223
00:12:40,000 --> 00:12:41,640
Besides, didn't you say

224
00:12:42,400 --> 00:12:44,360
you hoped I'd wear them
when I achieved my dream?

225
00:12:45,000 --> 00:12:45,640
In ten days,

226
00:12:45,640 --> 00:12:47,840
I'll make my debut as principal.

227
00:12:48,360 --> 00:12:49,240
When I do,

228
00:12:49,480 --> 00:12:50,840
I'll wear them onstage.

229
00:12:53,440 --> 00:12:54,040
Okay.

230
00:12:58,800 --> 00:12:59,720
I'm sorry

231
00:13:00,400 --> 00:13:02,080
I couldn't be by your side
all these years.

232
00:13:04,560 --> 00:13:05,800
(I hope this time,)

233
00:13:06,560 --> 00:13:08,080
(we can make it to the end together.)

234
00:13:10,840 --> 00:13:13,960
(2025/04/04 7:22)

235
00:13:14,360 --> 00:13:15,920
(The car accident happened
on this date last time.)

236
00:13:15,960 --> 00:13:17,600
(If we can just make it through
today safely,)

237
00:13:17,640 --> 00:13:19,360
(will we finally be okay?)

238
00:13:36,120 --> 00:13:37,200
What's with the act?

239
00:13:37,720 --> 00:13:38,920
If you want to hit me, just do it.

240
00:13:42,280 --> 00:13:43,880
If I wanted to hit you,

241
00:13:44,720 --> 00:13:46,120
why would I bring you here?

242
00:13:47,240 --> 00:13:48,440
Then what the hell do you want?

243
00:13:49,160 --> 00:13:49,960
Let me go!

244
00:13:52,880 --> 00:13:54,160
I just want to talk.

245
00:13:57,880 --> 00:13:59,440
So what's Luo Xiyu like in bed?

246
00:14:00,720 --> 00:14:01,320
Good?

247
00:14:02,440 --> 00:14:03,880
Don't bother trying to provoke me.

248
00:14:06,120 --> 00:14:07,800
I've got all night.

249
00:14:20,120 --> 00:14:21,560
You turned me into a cripple,

250
00:14:22,440 --> 00:14:23,720
and you get to live the good life.

251
00:14:24,480 --> 00:14:25,280
How's that fair?

252
00:14:26,800 --> 00:14:27,720
You're blaming the wrong person.

253
00:14:29,080 --> 00:14:29,880
What do you mean?

254
00:14:30,560 --> 00:14:33,120
Li Junsheng was the one
who kicked you off that wall.

255
00:14:33,840 --> 00:14:34,520
Not me.

256
00:14:36,760 --> 00:14:38,040
You think I'm an idiot?

257
00:14:38,640 --> 00:14:39,800
I was young,

258
00:14:39,840 --> 00:14:40,960
not blind.

259
00:14:41,040 --> 00:14:42,440
I recognized your clothes.

260
00:14:42,440 --> 00:14:44,120
Li Junsheng took my clothes.

261
00:14:45,240 --> 00:14:47,120
It wasn't the first time he'd framed me.

262
00:14:47,200 --> 00:14:49,360
Whenever he did something wrong,
he pinned it on me.

263
00:14:49,800 --> 00:14:51,600
So you didn't just nearly kill me,

264
00:14:52,440 --> 00:14:54,800
you nearly killed Li Junsheng too.

265
00:14:55,040 --> 00:14:57,120
He almost died because of you.

266
00:14:58,040 --> 00:14:58,640
What?

267
00:14:58,760 --> 00:15:00,400
Now you're trying to pin this
on him too?

268
00:15:01,160 --> 00:15:02,440
He brought it on himself.

269
00:15:02,840 --> 00:15:03,800
Ridiculous.

270
00:15:04,120 --> 00:15:06,200
You deliberately hurt him.

271
00:15:07,080 --> 00:15:08,400
If you did nothing wrong,

272
00:15:08,440 --> 00:15:09,560
why did you go to prison?

273
00:15:10,720 --> 00:15:12,120
Your brother barely survived,

274
00:15:12,520 --> 00:15:13,920
and he's still disabled.

275
00:15:14,560 --> 00:15:15,840
Even after what happened to him,

276
00:15:16,240 --> 00:15:17,840
you treat him worse than a dog.

277
00:15:18,280 --> 00:15:19,000
Wang Haotian,

278
00:15:21,320 --> 00:15:22,960
so you've been in contact
with Li Junsheng?

279
00:15:23,440 --> 00:15:24,600
Don't you think

280
00:15:25,000 --> 00:15:26,440
Li Junsheng hates you even more
than I do?

281
00:15:32,400 --> 00:15:35,920
(He Lan)

282
00:15:36,200 --> 00:15:37,840
